      "html": "<p>Wojciech Mazur is a Scala Tooling Engineer at VirtusLab with many years of commercial experience in projects using Scala. For the last 2 years, he has been responsible for the maintenance and development of Scala Native - a compiler and runtime environment for Scala-based on LLVM, in close cooperation with Scala Center and EPFL.</p>"
